      "message": "Hi Rongxuan!\n\nTHe idea here is to update inband ringtone support for \"old\" and \"new\" Fallback Broadacst To Unicast group. \nWhile being in broadcast mode and Fallback Broadcast to Unicast group changes e.g. A-\u003eB, then inband ringtone support for A needs to be disabled but enabled for B.\n\nDoes it make sense now for you ?\n\nThis pattern repeate twice - this is why I\u0027ve decided to use a one method that does:\n1. Cache \"old\" fallback group ID\n2. Change current fallback group ID (it\u0027s used internally in some functions of inband ringtone check etc.)\n3. Update inband ringtone for \"old\" fallback group\n4. Update inband ringtone for \"new\" fallback group",
